[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10202.07, "timestamp": "02:50:02", "text": "在将来某个时候。我想到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10205.269, "timestamp": "02:50:05", "text": "就像用我的手机一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10207.91, "timestamp": "02:50:07", "text": "捕捉一些瞬间，也许可以做点什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10210.63, "timestamp": "02:50:10", "text": "旁白，或者只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10213.269, "timestamp": "02:50:13", "text": "顺其自然，玩得开心就好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10216.71, "timestamp": "02:50:16", "text": "嗯，发上去吧，因为我有YouTube账号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10219.11, "timestamp": "02:50:19", "text": "立即加入会员。所以我认为我不应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10222.269, "timestamp": "02:50:22", "text": "即使我接下来要去那里，也保持不活跃状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10225.429, "timestamp": "02:50:25", "text": "月。如果我长时间不活跃，这种情况可能会发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10227.51, "timestamp": "02:50:27", "text": "就像小樱的遭遇一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10229.59, "timestamp": "02:50:29", "text": "她有两个月没直播了，或者说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10232.15, "timestamp": "02:50:32", "text": "两个月未活动，而且确实如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10234.23, "timestamp": "02:50:34", "text": "YouTube取消了盈利功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10237.51, "timestamp": "02:50:37", "text": "一切归零。哦，糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10239.67, "timestamp": "02:50:39", "text": "真糟糕。我对此并不知情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10243.11, "timestamp": "02:50:43", "text": "是啊，你会失去一切。全部4000"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10246.389, "timestamp": "02:50:46", "text": "观看时间会被重置。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10250.55, "timestamp": "02:50:50", "text": "坏的。坏的。所以，我想我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10253.429, "timestamp": "02:50:53", "text": "呃，上传视频之类的，看看效果如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10257.11, "timestamp": "02:50:57", "text": "就这样吧。是啊，听起来很美好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10259.99, "timestamp": "02:50:59", "text": "你可以发表你自己的看法。"}]